Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.58,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(160,480)\frz-90\1c&H882627&\fs40}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.42,0:15:51.68,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,100,180,0,250,2200,3300)\pos(740,260)\frz-90\1c&HFFF1FE&\fs32}对不起
